WEBVTT

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:26.210
Saint Seiya

00:01:32.660 --> 00:01:33.670
The Underworld.

00:01:34.430 --> 00:01:37.730
The land of the dead, ruled by Hades.

00:01:38.530 --> 00:01:40.370
A world without light.

00:01:40.370 --> 00:01:45.760
Young warriors of hope have entered
the Underworld in the name of peace.

00:01:46.540 --> 00:01:47.410
Yes, indeed.

00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:50.670
Orphée.

00:01:51.130 --> 00:01:55.700
You said you finished them off,

00:01:56.060 --> 00:01:58.580
what's going on?

00:01:59.050 --> 00:02:03.620
As suspected, you're still
on the side of the Saints.

00:02:03.750 --> 00:02:05.680
Tell me one thing.

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:12.320
That time, was it you who
created the light I saw?

00:02:13.970 --> 00:02:15.780
If so, what will you do about it?

00:02:16.730 --> 00:02:17.930
What will I do?

00:02:19.720 --> 00:02:21.530
What will I do?

00:02:27.650 --> 00:02:29.090
It's obvious.

00:02:30.390 --> 00:02:33.890
This will become your grave.

00:02:34.470 --> 00:02:42.480
Orphée, The Sad Requiem

00:02:45.850 --> 00:02:48.460
This will become my grave?

00:02:52.650 --> 00:02:53.680
Are you serious, Orpheé?

00:02:55.210 --> 00:02:59.260
My answer is through this song.

00:03:07.960 --> 00:03:10.140
This melody...

00:03:10.630 --> 00:03:13.340
It's so graceful and exquisite.

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:17.890
But it contains an unwavering determination.

00:03:20.620 --> 00:03:23.710
Yes. That's it, Orpheé.

00:03:24.570 --> 00:03:28.380
That is the Saint that I love.

00:03:30.260 --> 00:03:31.700
Lyra Orpheé.

00:03:40.290 --> 00:03:41.220
My hand.

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:49.250
Seiya.

00:03:53.870 --> 00:03:54.510
All right.

00:03:56.130 --> 00:03:57.460
You bastard.

00:03:57.850 --> 00:04:02.250
Have you forgotten what Lord
Hades has done for you?

00:04:03.990 --> 00:04:04.800
Fine.

00:04:05.400 --> 00:04:12.000
We'll see whose harp is more powerful.

00:04:12.630 --> 00:04:14.050
Listen to this.

00:04:14.430 --> 00:04:16.310
Requiem of the Underworld!

00:05:01.580 --> 00:05:02.740
His string!

00:05:02.830 --> 00:05:03.950
Orpheé!

00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:11.590
It's settled.

00:05:14.810 --> 00:05:20.410
What? One broken string won't stop Orpheé.

00:05:23.320 --> 00:05:24.390
You think so?

00:05:29.650 --> 00:05:30.570
Orpheé.

00:05:31.900 --> 00:05:33.000
Orpheé.

00:05:37.210 --> 00:05:41.720
The Pharaoh's harp is overwhelming Orpheé's.

00:05:41.850 --> 00:05:44.650
What's wrong, Orpheé?

00:05:48.310 --> 00:05:49.370
Orpheé.

00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:54.830
Your offensive chords are
produced by the G-string.

00:05:55.260 --> 00:05:57.910
It's unfortunate you broke your G-string.

00:06:01.530 --> 00:06:04.480
It's like you had your claws pulled out.

00:06:07.960 --> 00:06:10.700
It's hard to watch, Orpheé.

00:06:11.860 --> 00:06:13.170
That's right.

00:06:13.820 --> 00:06:16.540
I detest you.

00:06:23.150 --> 00:06:26.640
It used to be my job to play the harp

00:06:26.640 --> 00:06:29.870
for Lord Hades and Miss Pandora.

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:36.470
And then I had that role
taken away by you, a Saint.

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:43.740
I will never acknowledge that
you are better than me, Orpheé.

00:06:44.290 --> 00:06:47.120
I will prove it here.

00:06:47.980 --> 00:06:51.430
Now, die by my spell!

00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:54.850
Balance of...

00:06:55.520 --> 00:06:57.660
...Curse!

00:07:04.450 --> 00:07:06.630
It's that debilitating noise again.

00:07:07.240 --> 00:07:09.280
I can't move my body.

00:07:12.150 --> 00:07:16.720
Heart of Orpheé, free
yourself from his body.

00:07:19.810 --> 00:07:22.620
And then get on the sacred scale.

00:07:23.550 --> 00:07:24.980
He'll get us all!

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:27.730
Orpheé!

00:07:33.730 --> 00:07:35.460
What? What's this?

00:07:41.370 --> 00:07:43.280
It seems that the evil one

00:07:43.850 --> 00:07:45.430
is you.

00:07:50.040 --> 00:07:51.370
Orpheé!

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:52.700
Orpheé!

00:07:55.360 --> 00:07:57.580
Look at the mural, Pharaoh!

00:07:58.280 --> 00:08:00.530
The scale is tipping to one side.

00:08:05.520 --> 00:08:06.660
It can't be.

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:12.430
Now, by a spell that you cast yourself,

00:08:12.570 --> 00:08:14.850
your body and soul will be obliterated.

00:08:24.120 --> 00:08:25.300
What?

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:29.120
Could it be? What is going on?

00:08:30.250 --> 00:08:31.450
An illusion?

00:08:32.720 --> 00:08:34.260
Impossible.

00:08:34.860 --> 00:08:39.740
Did he stop the Balance of
Curse without his G-string?

00:08:40.860 --> 00:08:41.970
Orpheé.

00:08:43.260 --> 00:08:44.310
Orpheé.

00:08:50.050 --> 00:08:52.780
This is Pandora's mirror.

00:08:52.940 --> 00:08:54.540
It tricked me into thinking I saw sunlight.

00:08:57.460 --> 00:09:01.500
Because of this mirror, Eurydice and I...

00:09:05.170 --> 00:09:07.870
It's the light from Earth!

00:09:07.870 --> 00:09:09.890
We've finally arrived at the exit to Earth.

00:09:11.040 --> 00:09:13.530
Eurydice, look, it's the sun.

00:09:22.040 --> 00:09:23.340
Eurydice!

00:09:25.660 --> 00:09:26.940
Orpheé!

00:09:32.240 --> 00:09:33.930
Eurydice.

00:09:35.240 --> 00:09:37.830
It's no use crying over the past.

00:09:38.400 --> 00:09:41.590
No, on the contrary, I'm grateful.

00:09:41.590 --> 00:09:42.550
What?

00:09:44.490 --> 00:09:48.020
Eurydice, I love you.

00:09:48.700 --> 00:09:50.880
I love you deeply from my heart.

00:09:52.370 --> 00:09:58.530
So I wanted to retrieve your soul

00:09:59.130 --> 00:10:01.000
even if it meant betraying Athena.

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:12.630
But a flower that once
wilts will not bloom again.

00:10:13.250 --> 00:10:15.970
Humans, birds, bugs,

00:10:16.270 --> 00:10:20.760
and even the stars in the
sky only get one life.

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:24.000
That's why life is beautiful.

00:10:24.800 --> 00:10:25.910
I was wrong.

00:10:26.760 --> 00:10:32.220
I was wrong to try to bring
you back from the dead.

00:10:34.570 --> 00:10:35.620
Orpheé.

00:10:38.310 --> 00:10:42.690
What are you going to do now
that you realize your mistake?

00:10:44.720 --> 00:10:45.920
I will fight.

00:10:45.920 --> 00:10:46.630
What?

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:51.810
I will defeat Hades as Athena's Saint.

00:10:52.390 --> 00:10:57.030
Fool, you only blocked the
Balance of Curse once.

00:10:57.320 --> 00:11:00.730
And without your G-string,
you have no attack.

00:11:01.230 --> 00:11:04.090
I will finish you off for certain this time.

00:11:05.190 --> 00:11:06.500
Not again.

00:11:06.910 --> 00:11:11.480
Now listen to the Underworld
ruling over all you Saints!

00:11:14.840 --> 00:11:15.810
What?

00:11:16.880 --> 00:11:17.820
Why?

00:11:20.320 --> 00:11:21.340
No!

00:11:22.080 --> 00:11:24.780
He's holding the G-string with his teeth.

00:11:33.470 --> 00:11:35.730
Stringer Nocturne!

00:11:43.940 --> 00:11:49.170
So that is the harp that
delights even Lord Hades.

00:11:50.220 --> 00:11:51.390
I lose.

00:11:55.910 --> 00:11:57.100
Eurydice.

00:11:58.030 --> 00:12:00.760
Orpheé, thank you.

00:12:01.250 --> 00:12:03.830
Even in this form,

00:12:03.830 --> 00:12:08.060
I was able to stay alive
thanks to your music.

00:12:09.170 --> 00:12:13.080
But... But it's all right now.

00:12:15.650 --> 00:12:16.880
Eurydice.

00:12:18.680 --> 00:12:21.690
Farewell, Orpheé.

00:12:22.950 --> 00:12:26.050
Orpheé, thank you.

00:12:59.420 --> 00:13:02.250
Right now, in the Underworld,

00:13:02.740 --> 00:13:06.930
a beautiful and precious life has passed.

00:13:07.240 --> 00:13:08.190
Let us hurry,

00:13:08.530 --> 00:13:11.300
to prevent further heartbreak.

00:13:13.670 --> 00:13:16.520
Now, let's go, you two.

00:13:17.010 --> 00:13:19.440
To the Third Prison?

00:13:19.820 --> 00:13:23.220
No. The Fourth Sphere of the Eighth Prison.

00:13:23.440 --> 00:13:26.140
To Giudecca, where Hades is.

00:13:26.410 --> 00:13:27.760
The Eighth Prison?

00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:29.130
Giudecca?

00:13:29.500 --> 00:13:35.230
There are things I know
because I served Hades.

00:13:35.760 --> 00:13:39.800
Listen, Hades is cautious.

00:13:40.080 --> 00:13:43.280
He doesn't appear in front of
anyone, even The Big Three.

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:46.680
But every 13 days,

00:13:46.730 --> 00:13:49.990
I am scheduled to play the harp for him.

00:13:50.940 --> 00:13:53.680
Today is that day.

00:13:54.270 --> 00:13:56.120
So then...

00:13:56.830 --> 00:13:57.800
That's right.

00:13:57.910 --> 00:14:01.930
This is our one and only chance to get Hades!

00:14:16.400 --> 00:14:18.370
Hyoga, look at that.

00:14:18.990 --> 00:14:19.830
What is that?

00:14:28.120 --> 00:14:32.650
What's going on? The dead are rolling rocks.

00:14:32.760 --> 00:14:38.610
It's punishment for their sins.
This must be the Third Prison.

00:14:38.920 --> 00:14:42.780
But what sins are they guilty of?

00:14:43.210 --> 00:14:44.680
I've heard of this.

00:14:45.090 --> 00:14:49.020
The Third Prison is for those
who were full of greed.

00:14:49.630 --> 00:14:52.270
They have to push boulders

00:14:52.390 --> 00:14:58.040
which are manifestations of their own greed.

00:15:00.010 --> 00:15:03.450
Those consumed with greed.

00:15:17.690 --> 00:15:21.470
I got three of Athena's Saints at once!

00:15:21.800 --> 00:15:24.020
This is the Third Prison.

00:15:24.020 --> 00:15:30.410
It's appropriate you Saints are
crushed by boulders of greed!

00:15:35.060 --> 00:15:36.550
What?

00:15:36.600 --> 00:15:39.310
They got away!

00:15:39.980 --> 00:15:41.290
Wait!

00:15:41.430 --> 00:15:42.690
I, Golem Rock,

00:15:42.690 --> 00:15:47.980
won't let you get any further
into the Third Prison!

00:15:48.190 --> 00:15:49.170
Take this!

00:15:49.460 --> 00:15:52.920
Rolling Bomber Stone!

00:15:56.470 --> 00:15:59.360
Die, Athena's Saints!

00:16:02.040 --> 00:16:03.690
I'm sorry, but we're in a hurry.

00:16:04.670 --> 00:16:09.600
Rising Dragon Punch!

00:16:24.210 --> 00:16:28.000
Too strong... He's too strong.

00:16:39.840 --> 00:16:42.350
Shiryu, your vision has seemed to return

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:44.490
since you arrived in the Underworld.

00:16:44.740 --> 00:16:48.330
Right, it was the same when I was hit

00:16:48.330 --> 00:16:50.240
with Deathmask's Layers of Death.

00:16:50.490 --> 00:16:53.920
In the Underworld, vision has
nothing to do with the eyes.

00:16:56.770 --> 00:16:59.320
Bastards, where do you think you're going?

00:16:59.710 --> 00:17:03.060
I won't let you pass the Third Prison.

00:17:03.160 --> 00:17:05.710
My name is...

00:17:08.780 --> 00:17:11.770
Diamond Dust!

00:17:18.950 --> 00:17:21.690
My name is...

00:17:30.750 --> 00:17:33.950
It seems like we have passed
the Third Prison now.

00:17:34.080 --> 00:17:36.580
But where are Shun and Seiya?

00:17:36.820 --> 00:17:40.480
Right, and I wonder about Grand Master.

00:17:40.480 --> 00:17:42.360
Don't lose focus.

00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:45.230
All the Saints in the Underworld

00:17:45.230 --> 00:17:47.220
are headed for the Eighth
Prison where Hades is.

00:17:47.510 --> 00:17:49.250
The Giudecca.

00:17:50.020 --> 00:17:52.220
Getting there is our priority.

00:17:52.960 --> 00:17:54.320
The Eighth Prison.

00:17:54.900 --> 00:17:56.060
Giudecca.

00:17:57.050 --> 00:17:58.180
That's where...

00:17:59.150 --> 00:18:01.540
Hades is.

00:18:04.280 --> 00:18:10.280
Giudecca

00:18:17.310 --> 00:18:21.640
Ruler of the Underworld, Lord Hades.

00:18:23.780 --> 00:18:28.090
You are my... My...

00:18:28.880 --> 00:18:30.140
Miss Pandora.

00:18:32.370 --> 00:18:33.600
Lyra Orphée.

00:18:34.720 --> 00:18:37.100
I have returned.

00:18:38.170 --> 00:18:41.030
Orphée, I've been waiting for you.

00:18:41.430 --> 00:18:45.500
Today is the day you play for Lord Hades.

00:18:47.070 --> 00:18:47.720
Yes.

00:18:50.640 --> 00:18:52.940
Where is Lord Hades?

00:18:53.100 --> 00:18:55.240
He'll be here shortly.

00:18:56.010 --> 00:18:57.820
Wait right there.

00:19:01.930 --> 00:19:02.820
Wait.

00:19:04.260 --> 00:19:06.280
What is in that chest?

00:19:07.490 --> 00:19:08.260
Huh?

00:19:08.530 --> 00:19:10.410
What are you referring to?

00:19:10.760 --> 00:19:14.450
Don't act dumb, what's inside?

00:19:14.900 --> 00:19:16.630
Open it and show me.

00:19:30.100 --> 00:19:33.750
What's wrong? Why won't you show me?

00:19:35.750 --> 00:19:37.140
I want to show...

00:19:38.240 --> 00:19:41.390
Lord Hades what is inside personally.

00:19:41.560 --> 00:19:44.830
What? To Lord Hades? Never.

00:19:46.230 --> 00:19:49.910
Anything for Lord Hades

00:19:50.600 --> 00:19:53.400
must pass by me.

00:19:53.910 --> 00:19:56.820
Now, open that chest.

00:19:58.540 --> 00:20:02.840
I wanted to show Lord Hades personally.

00:20:03.200 --> 00:20:07.180
Suspicious bastard, what are you scheming?

00:20:07.920 --> 00:20:12.690
This is the Underworld,
residence of Lord Hades.

00:20:13.350 --> 00:20:18.030
There is no reason to go directly to him.

00:20:18.530 --> 00:20:21.990
Especially a Saint like you.

00:20:25.230 --> 00:20:26.120
What's this?

00:20:26.830 --> 00:20:32.370
Yes, at the Second Prison,

00:20:32.370 --> 00:20:34.090
where I stay,

00:20:34.310 --> 00:20:37.740
is the only place where flowers
bloom in the Underworld.

00:20:38.560 --> 00:20:43.090
I wanted to offer these to Lord Hades.

00:20:43.420 --> 00:20:46.930
I see. Flowers.

00:21:07.670 --> 00:21:11.280
Nothing there. Orphée.

00:21:12.040 --> 00:21:16.970
I apologize for questioning
your loyalty to Lord Hades.

00:21:17.440 --> 00:21:21.340
We're in a state of emergency,
and I'm being overly cautious.

00:21:23.690 --> 00:21:24.610
Of course.

00:21:25.300 --> 00:21:29.050
Now, let's lighten things up with your harp.

00:21:29.180 --> 00:21:33.520
When you play your harp,
Lord Hades will draw near.

00:21:35.510 --> 00:21:36.230
Yes.

00:21:38.440 --> 00:21:40.290
Seiya, Shun,

00:21:40.920 --> 00:21:44.320
I hope you didn't get
stabbed by Pandora's spear.

00:21:45.730 --> 00:21:51.240
We can't lose our one and only chance.

00:22:01.790 --> 00:22:02.980
What?

00:22:03.870 --> 00:22:05.310
Who are they?

00:22:06.570 --> 00:22:07.860
Aiacos.

00:22:11.000 --> 00:22:12.480
Rhadamanthys.

00:22:16.540 --> 00:22:17.790
Minos.

00:22:22.660 --> 00:22:24.590
The top three of the Underworld.

00:24:02.700 --> 00:24:05.780
In order to slay Hades,
Orphée heads to the Eighth Prison.

00:24:06.220 --> 00:24:11.630
The melody of determination he played there,

00:24:12.090 --> 00:24:15.630
put those in the court to sleep.

00:24:16.370 --> 00:24:20.460
But we are astonished when
we see Hades' true form.

00:24:21.590 --> 00:24:24.670
Saint Seiya:
"Hades! An Astonishing Identity."

00:24:25.050 --> 00:24:27.850
Have you ever felt your Cosmo?
